# FrameRef cache directory
/.frameref

# Generated by scripts/generate_tool_inventory.py, which the declared
# validation authority (repo.yaml -> scripts/ci/verify-toolchain.sh) runs on
# every invocation. Without this rule the gate leaves an untracked artifact in
# the working tree, so a routine `git add -A` can commit generated output.
# Narrow on purpose: the file, not the directory, so a future real document
# under reports/ is still visible to git (repository-shape.yml requires narrow
# rules and prohibits broad patterns that could hide legitimate source).
/reports/toolchain-inventory.json
Thumbs.db
*.log
